text:
The Pipe: |&gt;
Read |&gt; as “and then.”

# nested: read inside out
arrange(filter(midwest, state == "WI"), poptotal)

# piped: read top to bottom
midwest |&gt;
  filter(state == "WI") |&gt;
  arrange(poptotal)

To get |&gt; instead of %&gt;% (in RStudio on your machine), go to Tools → Global Options → Code and check Use native pipe operator. This is already enabled in Posit Cloud!

